[PrintTextModified Text:我端着食物托盘，<br>站在诺亚的房间门口。|#0201Adv08_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_21_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:这到底是怎么回事……|#0201Adv08_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:MainBackground Loop:false
@SpawnExtended Path:MaskingRectangle Params:200,200,true,0.5,#000000cc ScenePosition:-7,50 Rotation:,,-10 SubId:Front
