[PrintTextModified Text:我惊呆了。<br>——房间内部被喷漆涂成了整面鲜红色。|#0201Adv08_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:你这是要干什么！？|#0201Adv08_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我严厉地质问道，<br>诺亚一脸疑惑地转过身来。|#0201Adv08_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25,45 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1,ArmL5 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯？慌慌张张的，有什么事吗？|#0201Adv08_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么把房间涂成红色！|#0201Adv08_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:喷漆颜料的气味充满了整个房间，<br>让人不禁屏住呼吸。|#0201Adv08_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25,45 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1,ArmL1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:因为它怎么都不肯变成诺亚想画的样子，<br>所以就想把它涂掉。|#0201Adv08_Noah002| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25,45 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Flushed,ArmL1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:然后，就全都变成这样子了。|#0201Adv08_Noah003| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看着稍微有些害羞的诺亚，<br>我的视野开始摇晃。|#0201Adv08_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这是错误的，这是错误的，这是错误的！）|#0201Adv08_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:把它清理掉！立刻！|#0201Adv08_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25,45 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1,ArmL1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:欸～为什么啊？<br>诺亚只是在画画而已啊？|#0201Adv08_Noah004| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:不论这对你来说是爱好还是艺术，<br>熏人的气味已经飘到过道里了，<br>这对其他人来说就是一种骚扰行为。|#0201Adv08_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25,45 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive1,ArmL2 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:……是这样啊，诺亚没注意到……|#0201Adv08_Noah005| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看着垂头丧气的诺亚，<br>我深深地叹了口气。|#0201Adv08_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

; ＠備考◆少し優しげに

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然我很想让你想做什么就做什么，<br>但是，到这种程度，已经不能坐视不理了。<br>不过，清理起来应该会很麻烦，所以我也会帮忙。|#0201Adv08_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:淋浴房里应该有肥皂，<br>用肥皂来擦的话……|#0201Adv08_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25,45 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1,ArmL5 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，不用。不需要那种东西的。|#0201Adv08_Noah006| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; カラースプレーを吸い込む音（魔法）
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_113 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:1.5 TintColor:#ffffff Duration:3 Lazy:false ScenePosition:10,80 AppearanceAndTransition:1_1 SubId:Front
@Wait WaitMode:2

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚轻描淡写地说着，<br>然后将所有的红色<br>都哧溜溜地收进了喷漆罐里。|#0201Adv08_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看到这明显超出常理的液体移动，<br>我恍然大悟。|#0201Adv08_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（魔法……她的魔法是让画动起来……<br>　不，是能操控液体……？）|#0201Adv08_Hiro009|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@UpdateWitchBook Id:Noah Category:Profile Version:8

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25,45 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1,ArmL1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:你看，干净了吧～！这样可以了吗？|#0201Adv08_Noah007| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:房间里已经恢复原状了。|#0201Adv08_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……是啊。那就这样吧。|#0201Adv08_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25,45 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1,ArmL5 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:那诺亚就开始画下一幅画啦。|#0201Adv08_Noah008| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:不行不行，你有没有听我说话？<br>这里禁止画画。|#0201Adv08_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25,45 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive1,ArmL5 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:欸——那不可能的啊？<br>因为诺亚不画画就活不下去啊。|#0201Adv08_Noah009| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:忍耐一下吧。<br>这里是大家一起生活的地方。|#0201Adv08_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25,45 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Angry1,ArmL1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:唔——诺亚忍不了——|#0201Adv08_Noah010| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚鼓起腮帮子，<br>显然心情变得很糟糕。|#0201Adv08_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（真是的……这种不愿意顾及他人的态度，<br>真的很像【小雪】）|#0201Adv08_Hiro013| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:突然，这个想法浮现在脑海中，<br>使我的感情泛起涟漪。|#0201Adv08_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——不能放着她不管。|#0201Adv08_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……好吧。<br>我来帮你另找一个能进行艺术创作的地方。<br>这样可以吗？|#0201Adv08_Hiro014| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25,45 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1,ArmR4,ArmL2 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:不能在这里画吗？|#0201Adv08_Noah011| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不行。|#0201Adv08_Hiro015| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25,45 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Angry1,ArmR1,ArmL2 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:小气鬼～|#0201Adv08_Noah012| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:随你怎么说。只要我在，<br>就不许你擅自行动。|#0201Adv08_Hiro016| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，对了，我给你带来了这个。|#0201Adv08_Hiro017| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我这才想起自己还端着食物托盘，<br>赶紧递给了她。|#0201Adv08_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:刚刚还气鼓鼓的诺亚，立刻露出了笑容。|#0201Adv08_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25,45 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1,ArmL2 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:哇，是饭啊！说起来诺亚肚子饿了！|#0201Adv08_Noah013| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25,45 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1,ArmR4,ArmL2 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:谢谢你，呃……|#0201Adv08_Noah014| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗。我叫二阶堂希罗。|#0201Adv08_Hiro018| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25,45 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1,ArmR1,ArmL2 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:谢谢你，希罗！<br>那个，诺亚的名字是——|#0201Adv08_Noah015| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我知道。你的名字是城崎诺亚。|#0201Adv08_Hiro019| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25,45 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Surprised1,ArmR1,ArmL2 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:欸，为什么会知道呢？希罗好厉害啊。|#0201Adv08_Noah016| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:……下次要准时去吃饭。<br>就算你不愿意，我也会强行把你带去的。|#0201Adv08_Hiro020| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

